            <div xml:id="d491">

                <pb facs="0537" n="525" xml:id="pg525"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">352.1115/3744: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Bilbao</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Chapman</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">on Board the U. S. S.
                        “Kane”</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-09">July 9, 1937</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 7, 9 p.m. We fail to understand how subject of Basque children arose in
                    your conversation with Aguirre. Since discussion of this subject may give rise
                    to unjustified hopes as to their admission into the United States, we feel that
                    such discussion should always be avoided as much as possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
